New!
  
You are now able to choose a new booking model for your new properties on the Smily' booking.com app: Request to book;
🚀 Benefits for you:
You can enable Request to book on booking.com' Smily app and manage all the requests through Smily’ Inquiries
Find out how below 👇

ℹ️ How to use it?
If you set your rental as non Instantly bookable from the PMS > Rental > Base > do not tick the box below - it will be on request to book model for all your channels;

If you only want to apply it for booking.com for example, you can tick Instantly bookable above as we’ve added a specific setting on the booking.com Smily’ app
When you drag and drop a new listing to be created on booking.com, you will get the new option Booking model to choose from the property settings;


